{"title":"Black Walnut Storage Chest","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Carpentry Lv 54)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Carpentry at level 54 <span class=\"muted\">(1281 XP)</span> from 11× <a href=\"#/item/black-walnut-plank\">Black Walnut Plank</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/gold-fittings\">Gold Fittings</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/carpentry\">Carpentry</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Other materials</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/oak-storage-chest\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/880112f4db216d02eb2c.svg\" alt=\"\">Oak Storage Chest</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/shagbark-storage-chest\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/fb410b8fba5306e1fc0c.svg\" alt=\"\">Shagbark Storage Chest</a></p><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/black-walnut-plank\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/0c38f25bf22070729979.svg\" alt=\"\">Black Walnut Plank</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/gold-fittings\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/07f49f58a10822b3bc5a.svg\" alt=\"\">Gold Fittings</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/cc2217d3ea32280026d1.svg\" alt=\"Black Walnut Storage Chest\"></div><h3>Black Walnut Storage Chest</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Carpentry 54</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}